    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Immaculate 2 bedroom terraced house with office\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2001, 7 Mount Auburn Close is a warm and inviting home, beautifully presented and thoughtfully laid out   in a quiet cul-de-sac in Bryanstown just off the Dublin Road. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of a living room which opens into the spacious kitchen and dining area and guest wc downstairs. Upstairs, the property offers two well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom and a cleverly designed home office area, featuring a pocket door which provides privacy while making excellent use of the available space.\r\n\r\nThe property has benefited from a number of recent upgrades, including a new boiler, hardwired Gigabit connectivity throughout, USB wall sockets, and a zero-maintenance dry verge and dry ridge roofing system. Further improvements include a new extension roof, a fully floored attic providing valuable additional storage, and the reconfiguration of one of the bedrooms to create a private and practical home office.\r\n\r\nOutside the stepped garden is low maintenance with a circular patio for enjoying the sunny evenings. A colourful shed completes the exterior.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in the popular Mount Auburn development, just off the Dublin Road in Drogheda.\r\nA host of local amenities, Drogheda town centre and the train station are all a short walk..\r\nExcellent access to the M1 motorway makes this an ideal location for commuters."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall: 4.61m x 1.95m Laminate floor, radiator cover, understairs built-in storage.\r\nSitting Room: 4.11m x 3.1m Laminate floor, fireplace, double doors to: \r\nKitchen/dining: L shape 5.18m x 2.96m & 3m x 2.93m, tiled floor, bult-in hob and oven, range of wall and floor units.\r\nDownstairs wc: whb & wc.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding: Hotpress, built-in shelving unit, storage press.\r\nBathroom: 2.18m x 2.16m whb, wc, electric shower over bath.\r\nBedroom 1: 3.48m x 2.92m, Laminate floor.\r\nBedroom 2: 3.02m x 2.95m Laminate floor, pocket door.\r\nHome office: Pocket door."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Turnkey home \r\nLow maintenance back garden (no mowing) with shed\r\nHardwired Gigabit throughout the house\r\nClever home office following room reconfiguration.\r\nFully floored attic\r\nExcellent location close to train and bus transport options.\r\nDry verge and dry ridge roofing system.\r\nFully floored attic\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nGas Fired Central heating\r\nMains water\r\nMains sewerage"
      },
